  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A metallic rod of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> is placed in North-South direction and is moved at a constant speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> towards East. The horizontal component of the Earth&#39;s magnetic field at that place is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> and the angle of dip is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>. The emf induced in the rod is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mV</mi></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8cb9ce9a-72ba-4b3f-8f81-e25c10734098-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 139px;\" /></p><p>Emf produced is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#949;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><msub><mi>L</mi><mo>&#8869;</mo></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8869;</mo></msub></math></p><p>We know&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#949;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mV</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
